ApplianceSupportBridgeCommandRequestDto.description:
Singular WebAPI request body for support bridge connect/disconnect.

Enable (timed):   { "appliance_id": "...", "enabled": true,  "duration_hours": 8 }
Enable (always):  { "appliance_id": "...", "enabled": true  }
Enable (always):  { "appliance_id": "...", "enabled": true,  "duration_hours": 0 }
Disable:          { "appliance_id": "...", "enabled": false }

``duration_hours=0`` is equivalent to omitting the field — both mean "no auto-expiry".
